lex":"0 0 auto","gap":2},"id":"n-variant-count","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"name":"message-circle","size":12,"tone":"muted"},"id":"n-variant-count-icon","type":"Icon"},{"config":{"text":"1","tone":"muted","variant":"label"},"id":"n-variant-count-n","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Comments tab: rows","spec":{"accessibility":["Status is a glyph with its words for assistive technology, never color alone; the canvas glyph has an accessible name and the message count is read as \"n messages\"."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Icon, Avatar, SegmentedControl, Segment); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The glyphs are shown by Variants; in the app each also carries a tooltip with the same words, and its sr-only text, here its accessible name. A row's hover and current fills are not modelled.","The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys; a Variant name binds through value, so a row names one missing Variant, the names and Widget ids are identities and are not translated, and a removed member is one sample string per Locale.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities; en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened the Comments tab of a View whose threads have the kinds below; the base state lists one row of each status: open, ready for review, resolved, dismissed and one that cannot be placed.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the rows are Workbench chrome, so their text follows the Workbench language and is baked here per Locale. The thread titles, names and times are sample content."],"intent":"Show the rows of the Comments tab in detail as built from Adapter Widgets only: what one row says about its thread (status, author, title, target, Variant scope, time and message count), who the author can be, why a pin is not on the canvas, and the notes a thread whose anchor no longer holds carries.","interactionRules":["A row is one target: its status glyph (open, ready for review, resolved, dismissed or the caution of a thread that cannot be placed), the author's mark (initials of a person, a bot glyph for an Agent), the title, the author and target (the Widget type and id, or Whole View), then the time and the number of messages.","An author who left the roster keeps the recorded name with \"(removed)\"; a thread with no author says Unknown author.","A thread whose pin is not on the canvas stays listed and opens like any other; a glyph before the time says why: scrolled out of view (an arrow at the edge it lies beyond), the pin point not visible, the Widget not visible in this state, or the canvas not measurable.","A thread whose Widget is gone says so in words and offers Re-anchor, and is never moved, resolved or deleted by the removal; a named Variant that no longer exists is listed under the row, and the thread is kept."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"c6c0a101-7b3e-4d19-8a26-3e9d1c0b6a01"}],"requirements":["01a11544-5228-70b4-96be-e5e032bb3b63"]},"variants":{"anchor-notes":{"requirements":["01a11544-5228-70b4-96be-e5e032bb3b63","01a11544-524d-7fd7-aa5e-d3f4388bdd41","01a11544-5201-70e6-9e60-a2433deb62b0","01a11544-5d60-705e-b88a-d2e8743cba14"],"state":{"s-authors":{"visible":false},"s-base":{"visible":false},"s-glyphs":{"visible":false},"s-notes":{"visible":true}}},"authors":{"state":{"s-authors":{"visible":true},"s-base":{"visible":false},"s-glyphs":{"visible":false},"s-notes":{"visible":false}}},"pin-not-on-canvas":{"requirements":["01a11544-5d39-733d-9581-eccc137f7263","01a11544-5d12-7146-9dc0-a05068a6ee77"],"state":{"s-authors":{"visible":false},"s-base":{"visible":false},"s-glyphs":{"visible":true},"s-notes":{"visible":false}}}}}
